usage: flair diffexp [-h] --counts_matrix COUNTS_MATRIX -o OUTPUT [-t THREADS]
                     [--min_expression MIN_EXPRESSION]
                     [--condition_a CONDITION_A] [--condition_b CONDITION_B]
                     [--overwrite_output]

Differential expression and differential usage analysis

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -t THREADS, --threads THREADS
                        number of threads for parallel DRIMSeq (default: 4)
  --min_expression MIN_EXPRESSION
                        read count expression threshold; isoforms in which
                        both conditions contain fewer than this many reads are
                        filtered out (default: 10)
  --condition_a CONDITION_A
                        the reference condition, as named in the counts matrix
                        columns; fold changes are reported for --condition_b
                        relative to this. With neither this nor --condition_b
                        given, the two conditions are taken in sorted order
  --condition_b CONDITION_B
                        the condition compared against --condition_a
  --overwrite_output    overwrite files in an existing output directory

required named arguments:
  --counts_matrix COUNTS_MATRIX
                        tab-delimited isoform count matrix from flair quantify
  -o OUTPUT, --output OUTPUT
                        output directory for tables and plots
